// ─── getadaapp.com/privacy + /support — Cloudflare static-assets Worker ──────
//
// ⚠ THIS FILE MAKES `web/` PUBLISH. It did not, until 2026-08-30.
//   `npm run web:deploy` uploads EVERYTHING in ./web as the Worker's asset
//   manifest and serves it at the two routes below. Both are registered with
//   the app stores: /privacy is the Privacy URL, /support is the Support URL.
//
// ─── WHY THIS LIVES HERE NOW ────────────────────────────────────────────────
//
// It used to live in ~/ada-worker-support — one laptop, no git, no remote —
// and became unfindable. Tracking it down took a header trace (x-vercel-id
// present on `/`, absent on `/privacy`) because the vault note that should have
// answered it said "No Worker exists", which was wrong.
//
// Folding it in removes a COPY rather than adding process on top of three:
// web/privacy.html used to be a dead mirror of the deployed file, and is now
// the deployed file itself. Copies of one document drifting apart is the whole
// failure class here — docs/privacy.html, the LegalScreen const and this page
// sat at June 2026 / July 2026 / July 11 2026 simultaneously.
//
// ─── DO NOT CHANGE THE THREE ASSET SETTINGS WITHOUT MEASURING FIRST ─────────
//
// Each one has an observable consequence in production, verified by curl
// against the live site on 2026-08-30 BEFORE this file moved:
//
//   routes (exactly two, no wildcard)
//       The Worker owns ONLY /privacy and /support. Everything else on the
//       zone — including /logo.png, which both pages reference — never reaches
//       the Worker and is served by Vercel (ada-web), 242933 B, verified live.
//       web/logo.png — a stale 80957 B DIFFERENT image — was DELETED on 2026-08-30
//       rather than guarded: with no file there is nothing for a future wildcard
//       route to shadow. The no-wildcard assertion stays anyway, because it
//       protects every other Vercel-served path too, not just that one.
//
//   not_found_handling: "none"
//       An unmatched path falls THROUGH to Vercel instead of the Worker
//       serving a 404. This is why /privacyzz returns a Next.js 404.
//       Change it to "404-page" or "single-page-application" and the fall-
//       through stops.
//
//   html_handling: "auto-trailing-slash"
//       /privacy/ → 308 → /privacy. Both stores hold the extensionless URL.
//
// Preserved character-for-character from ~/ada-worker-support/wrangler.jsonc
// (deployed 2026-07-12, version dc33bcb5). Only `directory` changed: ./public → ./web.
{
  "name": "getadaapp",
  "account_id": "76f3dd64113159c180309aeb2b8583c4",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-06-19",
  "assets": {
    "directory": "./web",
    "html_handling": "auto-trailing-slash",
    "not_found_handling": "none"
  },
  "routes": [
    { "pattern": "getadaapp.com/support", "zone_name": "getadaapp.com" },
    { "pattern": "getadaapp.com/privacy", "zone_name": "getadaapp.com" }
  ]
}
